00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.334
A stunning

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:01.968
new court

00:00:01.968 --> 00:00:04.471
filing shows Fox anchors and executives

00:00:04.471 --> 00:00:05.872
privately ridiculed former

00:00:05.872 --> 00:00:06.973
President Trump's lies

00:00:06.973 --> 00:00:08.108
about the election,

00:00:08.108 --> 00:00:10.043
