00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:26.065
This was new information

00:04:26.065 --> 00:04:27.533
that hadn't been uncovered at any point

00:04:27.533 --> 00:04:28.868
the last couple of years.

00:04:28.868 --> 00:04:30.803
I do think it's also striking

00:04:30.803 --> 00:04:34.173
how the opinion hosts had such sway over

00:04:34.173 --> 00:04:37.944
what was being broadcast news wise.

00:04:37.977 --> 00:04:39.479
And it's just

00:04:39.479 --> 00:04:41.514
it's really jarring noticing

00:04:41.514 --> 00:04:43.716
how Donald Trump is not on Fox right now.

00:04:43.716 --> 00:04:45.151
I wonder what that will look like

00:04:45.151 --> 00:04:47.186
in the future as he remains a candidate.

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:47.887
Yeah,

00:04:47.887 --> 00:04:49.255
it is really jarring on

00:04:49.255 --> 00:04:50.923
so many fronts here.

00:04:50.923 --> 00:04:52.058
What do you think, Oliver?

00:04:52.058 --> 00:04:52.325
I mean,

00:04:52.325 --> 00:04:54.427
how much do you think this was motivated

00:04:54.427 --> 00:04:55.261
by a desire

00:04:55.261 --> 00:04:56.162
to appease viewers

00:04:56.162 --> 00:04:58.331
and preserve television ratings?

00:04:58.331 --> 00:04:59.065
These texts

00:04:59.065 --> 00:05:01.067
and communications are very telling.

00:05:01.067 --> 00:05:03.002
I think it was entirely motivated

00:05:03.002 --> 00:05:05.104
by the business decision, which was that

00:05:05.104 --> 00:05:05.772
they did not

00:05:05.772 --> 00:05:07.307
want to alienate their audience.

00:05:07.307 --> 00:05:08.007
And their audience

00:05:08.007 --> 00:05:08.508
was listening

00:05:08.508 --> 00:05:09.976
to Trump, was listening to Rudy

00:05:09.976 --> 00:05:11.911
Giuliani, was listening to Sidney Powell.

00:05:11.911 --> 00:05:13.012
And they wanted to believe

00:05:13.012 --> 00:05:14.914
that the election was stolen from him.

00:05:14.914 --> 00:05:15.882
They wanted to believe that

00:05:15.882 --> 00:05:18.117
Joe Biden was not the rightful

00:05:18.117 --> 00:05:19.452
president elect at the time

00:05:19.452 --> 00:05:20.453
and that this election

00:05:20.453 --> 00:05:22.055
could be overturned to Donald Trump.

00:05:22.055 --> 00:05:25.258
And so the Fox News hosts and executives,

00:05:25.258 --> 00:05:27.260
they couldn't have people on air,

00:05:28.561 --> 00:05:29.128
you know, going

00:05:29.128 --> 00:05:30.630
contrary to this narrative

00:05:30.630 --> 00:05:31.297
that was being pushed

00:05:31.297 --> 00:05:32.398
by the former president.

00:05:32.398 --> 00:05:35.301
And so what you see here is that they are

00:05:36.035 --> 00:05:37.236
they are,

00:05:37.370 --> 00:05:38.137
you know, desperate

00:05:38.137 --> 00:05:39.505
to appease the audience.

00:05:39.505 --> 00:05:40.773
You see in text messages

00:05:40.773 --> 00:05:42.375
behind the scenes where they talk

00:05:42.375 --> 00:05:42.608
about

00:05:42.608 --> 00:05:43.943
not offending the audience,

00:05:43.943 --> 00:05:45.411
respecting the audience,

00:05:45.411 --> 00:05:48.381
and in their eyes, I guess respecting

00:05:48.381 --> 00:05:49.882
the audience is not telling them

00:05:49.882 --> 00:05:52.185
inconvenient truths.

00:05:52.185 --> 00:05:53.486
I would argue that respecting

00:05:53.486 --> 00:05:54.954
the audience is being upfront with them

00:05:54.954 --> 00:05:55.922
about what they knew.

00:05:55.922 --> 00:05:57.490
And these text messages show

00:05:57.490 --> 00:05:58.057
that they knew

00:05:58.057 --> 00:05:59.225
the election was not stolen,

00:05:59.225 --> 00:06:00.893
but they were happy to prop this

00:06:00.893 --> 00:06:01.928
narrative up anyway.

00:06:01.928 --> 00:06:02.161
Yeah.

00:06:02.161 --> 00:06:03.129
I mean, the job of

00:06:03.129 --> 00:06:04.564
just telling the truth,

00:06:04.564 --> 00:06:05.932
that seems to be the best way to

00:06:05.932 --> 00:06:07.066
respect your audience.

00:06:08.234 --> 00:06:09.502
It is pretty, pretty

00:06:09.502 --> 00:06:10.837
stunning when you look at it that way.

00:06:10.837 --> 00:06:11.804
And we knew at the time

00:06:11.804 --> 00:06:12.338
I remember

00:06:12.338 --> 00:06:14.340
