00:06:17.443 --> 00:06:18.578
That, of course, as we see

00:06:18.578 --> 00:06:20.680
we see now inside the panic at Fox.

00:06:20.680 --> 00:06:22.315
And that was happening and Maggie,

00:06:22.315 --> 00:06:23.516
you just mentioned that

00:06:23.516 --> 00:06:24.417
that new information,

00:06:24.417 --> 00:06:25.918
I think all of us who covered the Trump

00:06:25.918 --> 00:06:26.419
White House

00:06:26.419 --> 00:06:28.454
